      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LOCKERBIE (6) was out of character last run when missing the frame, finishing fifth (31.36) in a Grade 5 at this track. Generally a safe beginner but buried in the ruck from a squeeze draw last time. Has winning claims on her best figures. ZIPPING RAPUNZEL (4) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by a neck at this track in a handy 31.13 beating Zinfandel Noah. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. MISS SINCLAIR (8) hasn't been far away here at the last two, finding the frame both times, most recently when second beaten 7 lengths (31.38). Yet to win here but has run some good races including four placings. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from five starts. Ready to find winning form. ZENVO YOYO (2) can run a bold race on best form.",
